            <tr><td>Text over hard-coded containers</td><td>Test with longer translated text and larger user font-size settings; fixed-height boxes clip content fluid ones don't.</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Motion</td><td>Respect <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> for parallax, autoplay, and large transitions.</td></tr>
